209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (Disaster preparedness remains fragmented, with limited integration of location-specific risk assessment, interactive preparedness education, practical training, and emergency assistance. Existing approaches often lack a unified platform that connects historical disaster risk insights with accessible learning resources and emergency support. This project develops SAFEREADY, an integrated multi-hazard preparedness platform that combines location-aware risk assessment, multilingual educational content, interactive learning, and emergency assistance to improve public awareness and preparedness.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
